│ TRIGGER: invocación manual / EventBridge schedule / API Gateway          │
│   Input: { "tenant": "tenant_anmat", "prefix": "tenant_anmat/2024/" }    │
└───────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                 ▼
╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  STEP FUNCTIONS: bulkrag-pipeline-{env}                                  ║
║                                                                          ║
║  [1] ListPdfsAndBuildManifests (Lambda)                                  ║
║      → lista PDFs del prefix en S3 (paginado)                           ║
║      → particiona en manifests de N archivos c/u                       ║
║      → escribe batch-poc/manifests/{tenant}/{run_id}/tanda_N.json       ║
║      → retorna lista de manifest keys                                   ║
║                          │                                              ║
║                          ▼                                              ║
║  [2] Map: RunExtractionTasks (MaxConcurrency configurable)              ║
║      ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐      ║
║      │ ECS RunTask .sync — una Task por manifest                 │      ║
║      │   container: rag-ecs-extractor                            │      ║
║      │   env: MANIFEST_S3_KEY, WORKER_COUNT=5                    │      ║
║      │   1 task = hasta 5 workers (ProcessPoolExecutor)           │      ║
║      │   State Machine espera a StoppedReason de cada task        │      ║
║      └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘      ║
║                          │  (espera a que TODAS las tasks terminen)     ║
║                          ▼                                              ║
║  [3] ConsolidateChunks (Lambda)                                         ║
║      → dispara solo tras completar el Map al 100%                       ║
║      → lee batch-poc/results/{run_id}/*_summary.json (auditoría)       ║
║      → lista pending-embeddings/{tenant}/{run_id}/*.jsonl               ║
║      → consolida en lotes de hasta 50,000 records                      ║
║      → escribe embeddings-input/{tenant}/{run_id}/batch_N.jsonl         ║
║      → retorna lista de batch input keys                                ║
║                          │                                              ║
║                          ▼                                              ║
║  [4] Map: LaunchBedrockBatchJobs (MaxConcurrency: 5)                    ║
║      ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐      ║
║      │ Bedrock CreateModelInvocationJob .sync                    │      ║
║      │   modelId: cohere.embed-multilingual-v3                   │      ║
║      │   input:  embeddings-input/{tenant}/{run_id}/batch_N.jsonl│      ║
║      │   output: embeddings-output/{tenant}/{run_id}/batch_N/    │      ║
║      │   State Machine espera a status Completed/Failed           │      ║
║      └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘      ║
║                          │  (espera a que TODOS los jobs terminen)      ║
║                          ▼                                              ║
║  [5] InsertVectorsToPgvector (Lambda, posible Map si hay varios batch)  ║
║      → lee embeddings-output/{tenant}/{run_id}/batch_N/*.jsonl.out      ║
║      → mapea recordId → chunk_id                                        ║
║      → bulk UPDATE/INSERT en Aurora pgvector (chunks)                   ║
║      → escribe pipeline-results/{run_id}/final_summary.json            ║
║                          │                                              ║
║                          ▼                                              ║
║                    [SUCCESS / FAILED]                                   ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
```

