## Ejecución del pipeline

### Invocación manual (AWS CLI)

```bash
aws stepfunctions start-execution \
  --state-machine-arn arn:aws:states:us-east-1:615216531593:stateMachine:bulkrag-pipeline-dev \
  --name "anmat-run-$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)" \
  --input '{
    "tenant": "tenant_anmat",
    "prefix": "tenant_anmat/2024/",
    "files_per_manifest": 200
  }' \
  --profile asap_dev
```

### Monitoreo

```bash
aws stepfunctions describe-execution \
  --execution-arn <arn-de-la-ejecucion> \
  --profile asap_dev

aws logs tail /aws/states/bulkrag-pipeline-dev --follow --profile asap_dev
```

